{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21111","headline":"书异 · 元稹","name":"书异","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"孟冬初寒月，渚泽蒲尚青。\n飘萧北风起，皓雪纷满庭。\n行过冬至後，冻闭万物零。\n奔浑驰暴雨，骤鼓轰雷霆。\n传云不终日，通宵曾莫停。\n瘴云愁拂地，急溜疑注缾。\n汹涌潢潦浊，喷薄鲸鲵腥。\n跳趫井蛙喜，突兀水怪形。\n飞蚋奔不死，修蛇蛰再醒。\n应龙非时出，无乃岁不宁。\n吾闻阴阳户，啓闭各有扃。\n後时无肃杀，废职乃玄冥。\n座配五天帝，荐用百品珍。\n权爲祝融夺，神其焉得灵。\n春秋雷电异，则必书诸经。\n仲冬雷雨苦，愿省蒙蔽刑。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21111.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21111","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}